      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village’s Pier Dance Hall became a Mecca for big‑band legends like Glen Miller, Tommy Dorsey, and Duke Ellington.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
